{"full":"hf:ibm-research/cuga-agent","spaceId":"ibm-research/cuga-agent","name":"CUGA Agent","source":"huggingface","description":"Configurable Generalist Agent, leader in AppWorld Benchmark","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":105,"created":"2025-12-08T17:39:32.000Z","updated":"2025-12-19T23:47:31.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://ibm-research-cuga-agent.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:31:26.802Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:31:26.802Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:31:26.802Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🤖","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Start with a generalist. Customize for your domain. Deploy faster!","Building a domain-specific enterprise agent from scratch is complex and requires significant effort: agent and tool orchestration, planning logic, safety and alignment policies, evaluation for performance/cost tradeoffs and ongoing improvements. CUGA is a state-of-the-art generalist agent designed with enterprise needs in mind, so you can focus on configuring your domain tools, policies and workflow."],"features":["High-performing generalist agent — Benchmarked on complex web and API tasks. Combines best-of-breed agentic patterns (e.g. planner-executor, code-act) with structured planning and smart variable management to prevent…","Configurable reasoning modes — Balance performance and cost/latency with flexible modes ranging from fast heuristics to deep planning, optimizing for your specific task requirements","Flexible agent and tool integration — Seamlessly integrate tools via OpenAPI specs, MCP servers, and Langchain, enabling rapid connection to REST APIs, custom protocols, and Python functions","Integrates with Langflow — Low-code visual build experience for designing and deploying agent workflows without extensive coding","Configurable policy and human-in-the-loop instructions (Experimental) — Configure policy-aware instructions and approval gates to improve alignment and ensure safe agent behavior in enterprise contexts"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a29c894f37362e0bca7db0ac87997da39b9866110cec6ac6b564494b9f78603f","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:31:26.832Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:31:26.832Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Start with a generalist. Customize for your domain. Deploy faster!","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Building a domain-specific enterprise agent from scratch is complex and requires significant effort: agent and tool orchestration, planning logic, safety and alignment policies, evaluation for performance/cost tradeoffs and ongoing improvements.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Create an account at platform.openai.com","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Create an account at openrouter.ai","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a29c894f37362e0bca7db0ac87997da39b9866110cec6ac6b564494b9f78603f","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:31:26.832Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-12-19T23:47:31.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ibm-research/cuga-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:31:26.832Z","hash":"a29c894f37362e0bca7db0ac87997da39b9866110cec6ac6b564494b9f78603f","originalBytes":22833,"storedBytes":22833,"truncat